  "title": "Royal Mint issues gold and silver John Lennon coins | 2025",
  "date": "2025-03-13",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>The Royal Mint has launched a range of official <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> gold and silver coins in the UK. <span id=\"more-128764\"></span></p><p>It comes just <a href=\"/2024/12/06/royal-mint-issues-gold-silver-paul-mccartney-coins/\">three months after a similar range</a> bearing the image of <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/john-lennon/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-128795\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"128795\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1400,1400\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon UK coins, Royal Mint 2025\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-960x960.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-960x960.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon UK coins, Royal Mint 2025\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" class=\"aligncenter size-large wp-image-128795\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_02.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"></a></p><p>There are 11 items available, ranging from an uncirculated £5 costing £18.50, to a 2oz gold proof coin, limited to 90 copies and costing £7,520. The full range can be purchased from the <a href=\"https://www.royalmint.com/shop/limited-editions/music-legends/john-lennon/\">Royal Mint website</a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/2025/03/13/royal-mint-issues-gold-and-silver-john-lennon-coins/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-128764 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMjAwIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDIwMCI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12-200x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon UK 1oz Silver Proof Colour Coin, Royal Mint 2025\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12-200x200.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12-580x580.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12-960x960.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12-768x768.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12.jpg 1500w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"128803\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/john-lennon/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/john-lennon-royal-mint-coin_12.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1500,1500\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon UK 1oz Silver Proof Colour Coin, Royal Mint 2025\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatl